			"othercredits"
			{
				"english"		"Christelle Canot — Vocals,\r\nCharles-Henry Martin — Piano,\r\nLili Richard-Gautier — Cello,\r\nCamille Marcos — Acoustic Guitars, Electric Guitars, Electric Bass, Percussions, Backing Vocals,\r\nJulien Ponsoda — Keyboards, Strings, Brass and Drums Programming, Percussions, Backing Vocals. \r\n\r\nThe Across the Grooves Original Soundtrack was composed and arranged by Camille Marcos and Julien Ponsoda (Illustrason).\r\nAll lyrics were written by Geoffroy Vincens.\r\n\r\nThe album was recorded, mixed, and mastered by Illustrason in Bordeaux in 2019 and 2020, and published by Nova-box.\r\n\r\nAdditional Music:\r\nDown to the Ground by The Neo Tabou Project\r\nWritten, composed and arranged by Geoffroy Vincens.\r\nGeoffroy Vincens — Vocals, Acoustic & Electric Guitar, Acoustic Bass, Glockenspiel.\r\nMaude Lamy de La Chapelle — Vocals.\r\n\r\nChaos by Asunder\r\nWritten by Geoffroy Vincens, composed by Jacques Malinvaud and arranged by Jacques Malinvaud & Geoffroy Vincens.\r\nGeoffroy Vincens — Vocals, Electric Guitars, Cymbals.\r\nJacques Malinvaud — Fretless Bass, Electric Guitars, Sound Effects and Drums Programming. "
